  "message": "Your playtest devlog reports two flag finishes and repeated pit falls, but its attachments show no gameplay. The goal remains at risk because no public build verifies the jump or first level. Use the remaining 10–15 hours to publish that short level with launch instructions, rather than adding content. We’ll meet at the final review; I look forward to your playable build and testing notes ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Publish an openable build with the jump, one short level, the flag and launch instructions.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Have someone outside the team open the build and test the second pit for jump or control problems.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

